WEBVTT

00:06:58.205 --> 00:07:00.799
unaffected by politics,

00:07:00.823 --> 00:07:02.316
then think twice.

00:07:03.607 --> 00:07:06.988
I am speaking to you
as a young woman from Libya,

00:07:07.012 --> 00:07:09.776
a country that is
in the middle of a civil war.

00:07:10.083 --> 00:07:13.298
After more than 40 years
of authoritarian rule,

00:07:13.322 --> 00:07:15.569
it's not a place
where political engagement

00:07:15.593 --> 00:07:18.520
by women and young people
is possible, nor encouraged.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:23.100
Almost all political dialogues
that took place in the past few years,

00:07:23.124 --> 00:07:25.490
even those gathered by foreign powers,

00:07:25.514 --> 00:07:28.346
has been with only
middle-aged men in the room.

00:07:29.235 --> 00:07:33.180
But in places with a broken
political system like Libya,